**Problem**: Sequential array access could benefit from prefetch hints.

**Solution**: Add prefetch in partition loop:

```cpp
while (k <= gt) {
    // Prefetch 8 cache lines ahead (512 bytes = 128 ints)
    __builtin_prefetch(&a[k + 128], 0, 3);  // Read, high temporal locality

    T val = a[k];
    // ... rest of partitioning
}
```

